ral entries are conditional restrictions (court or committee approval), as their Source_1 text says.","source":"Kristopher Velasco, LGBTI National Policy Dataset, Version 2.2 (OSF), file LGBTI_Policy_Data_Long.csv, policy \"Gender Assignment Surgeries on Children\"","url":"https://osf.io/wta9p/","data_url":"https://osf.io/download/zp78k/","codebook":"https://osf.io/download/qaeyj/","licence":"CC BY 4.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","licence_quote":"LICENSE file: \"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)\" (https://osf.io/download/3kpdm/)","citation":"Velasco, Kristopher. 2026. \"LGBTI National Policy Dataset, Version 2.2.\" https://doi.org/10.17605/OSF.IO/WTA9P. Distributed under CC BY 4.0.","years":"1991-2025","value_counts":{"No restriction coded":183,"Restricted by national law":11,"Restricted in part of the country":1},"count":195}}